# Expo's machine-local state: device history, dev-server settings, logs.
.expo/

# Native projects are generated from app.json and app.config.ts (continuous
# native generation) by `expo prebuild` or `expo run:*`. Committed, they would
# make EAS Build treat the app as a bare project and stop applying the app
# config: the build variants, the Swedish texts, the icons.
/ios/
/android/

# `eas env:pull` writes file variables here.
.eas/

# Push and signing credentials. google-services.json reaches EAS Build as the
# file variable GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md §12.3), never through
# the repository: the repository is public. The rest are what `eas
# credentials` and the stores hand out, and belong in the password manager.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
credentials.json
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
